{"path":"io/remove","title":"remove","titleHtml":"remove","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/io/remove","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Deletes the file identified by the character string pointed to by pathname.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/io\"><code>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> remove<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> pathname <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Deletes the file identified by the character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">pathname</span></code>.\n</p><p>If the file is currently open by any process, the behavior of this function is implementation-defined. POSIX systems unlink the file name (directory entry), but the filesystem space used by the file is not reclaimed while it is open in any process and while other hard links to the file exist. Windows does not allow the file to be deleted in such cases.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pathname\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a null-terminated string containing the path identifying the file to delete\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> upon success or non-zero value on error.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/remove.html\" data-external=\"1\">POSIX specifies</a> many additional details for the behavior of this function.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/FILE\"><span class=\"kw883\">FILE</span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> fp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/io/fopen\"><span class=\"kw819\">fopen</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"file1.txt\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"w\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// create file</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw879\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/c/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw494\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw836\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Created file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fclose\"><span class=\"kw822\">fclose</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> rc <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> remove<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>rc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw879\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"remove\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/c/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw494\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw836\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Removed file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    fp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/io/fopen\"><span class=\"kw819\">fopen</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"file1.txt\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"r\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Failure: file does not exist</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fp<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw879\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Opening removed file failed\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    rc <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> remove<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Failure: file does not exist</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>rc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw879\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Double-remove failed\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/c/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw493\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Created file1.txt\nRemoved file1.txt\nOpening removed file failed: No such file or directory\nDouble-remove failed: No such file or directory</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.21.4.1 The remove function (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.21.4.1 The remove function (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.21.4.1 The remove function (p: 302)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.19.4.1 The remove function (p: 268)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c89\">\n<ul><li> C89/C90 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1990): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 4.9.4.1 The remove function \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/rename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rename</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   renames a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/remove\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>remove</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"io","title":"File input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"remove","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Deletes the file identified by the character string pointed to by pathname."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pathname"},{"label":"Return value","note":"0 upon success or non-zero value on error."},{"label":"Notes","note":"POSIX specifies many additional details for the behavior of this function."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"rename","note":"renames a file"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":276,"codeBlockCount":2}
